sequenceDiagram
    title Chart Calculation — Data Flow

    participant Caller
    participant ArrowOptions as arrow_options
    participant SweFacade as SweFacade (arrow_swe)
    participant SWE as Swiss Ephemeris (native)
    participant EphSnapshot as EphSnapshot
    participant Chart as Chart (arrow_core)
    participant Varga as Varga / Rashi (arrow_core)
    participant ArrowCalc as arrow_calc

    Caller->>ArrowOptions: SweConfig(bodies, signAyanamsa, houseSystem, …)
    ArrowOptions-->>Caller: SweConfig
    Caller->>ArrowOptions: CalcConfig(circle, nakAyanamsa, traditions, …)
    ArrowOptions-->>Caller: CalcConfig
    Caller->>ArrowOptions: ArrowOptions(sweConfig, calcConfig)
    ArrowOptions-->>Caller: ArrowOptions

    Caller->>SweFacade: calcAll(jdUt, location, options)

    Note over SweFacade: Fail-fast: barycentric + Moshier → ArgumentError

    alt sidereal mode
        SweFacade->>SWE: setSidMode(signAyanamsa.sweCode)
    end
    alt topocentric
        SweFacade->>SWE: setTopo(lon, lat, alt)
    end

    loop per body (skip Ketu)
        SweFacade->>SWE: calcUt(jdUt, sweId, eclipticFlags)
        SWE-->>SweFacade: CalcResult (lon, lat, dist, speed)
        SweFacade->>SWE: calcUt(jdUt, sweId, equatorialFlags)
        SWE-->>SweFacade: CalcResult (equatorial)
        opt extra frames (bary / helio)
            SweFacade->>SWE: calcUt(jdUt, sweId, baryFlags | helioFlags)
            SWE-->>SweFacade: CalcResult
        end
    end

    Note over SweFacade: Ketu = Rahu + 180° — no SWE call

    SweFacade->>SWE: housesEx(jdUt, flags, lat, lon, hsys)
    SWE-->>SweFacade: HouseResult (cusps[1..12], AscMc)

    alt sidereal
        SweFacade->>SWE: getAyanamsaUt(jdUt)
        SWE-->>SweFacade: ayanamsaValue (degrees)
    end

    SweFacade->>SWE: calcSunTimes (rise/set/transit)
    SWE-->>SweFacade: SunTimes

    SweFacade-->>EphSnapshot: EphSnapshot(jdUt, location, options, bodiesEcliptic, bodiesEquatorial, cusps, ascmc, ayanamsaValue, sunTimes, phenoData, extraFrames)

    EphSnapshot-->>Caller: EphSnapshot

    Note over Caller,Chart: CalcConfig changes → reuse EphSnapshot, new Chart only

    Caller->>Chart: Chart(snapshot, calcConfig)
    Chart->>Varga: Rashi(snapshot, config) → Varga._init()

    Note over Varga: nakAyanamsa (default: dhruva) independent of signAyanamsa

    loop per body in snapshot
        Varga->>Varga: Planet(body, snapshot, config, VargaType.rashi)
    end
    loop karaka-eligible bodies
        Varga->>Varga: Karaka(planet)
    end
    loop cusps 1-12
        Varga->>Varga: Cusp(i+1, cusps[i], config)
    end
    loop signs 1-12
        Varga->>Varga: Sign(s, signPlanets, signCusps)
    end
    Varga->>Varga: _initNakshatras() → Nakshatra[1..27]

    Varga-->>Chart: Rashi (planets, karakas, cusps, signs, nakshatras)

    Note over Chart: D2..D60 vargas lazy-cached on first Chart.varga(type) call

    Chart-->>Caller: Chart

    Caller->>ArrowCalc: dashas(chart) / yogas(chart) / shadbala(chart) / …
    ArrowCalc-->>Caller: calculation results
